      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "If and only if the requested expiration interval is greater than zero AND smaller than one hour AND less than a registrar-configured minimum, the registrar MAY reject the registration with a response of 423 (Interval Too Brief).",
